.TH "dunelegacy-tornie" "6" "1.0.522" "Dune Legacy Tornie" ""
.SH NAME
dunelegacy-tornie \- Dune II real-time strategy engine based on Dune Legacy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dunelegacy
[--showlog] [--fullscreen|--window] [--PlayerName=X] [--ServerPort=X]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dune Legacy Tornie is an independent Dune Legacy-derived RTS project with Tornie gameplay, faction, campaign, editor, graphics and audio extensions.
.PP
Original Dune II data files are required separately.
.SH FILES
User configuration is stored in the platform-specific DuneLegacyTornie configuration directory.
